{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# ML Model Factory - Unified Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "**Complete ML training pipeline for OHLCV time series with 23 models.**\n",
    "\n",
    "## Features\n",
    "\n",
    "### Model Support (23 Models)\n",
    "- **Boosting (3):** XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost\n",
    "- **Classical (3):** Random Forest, Logistic Regression, SVM\n",
    "- **Neural (10):** LSTM, GRU, TCN, Transformer, PatchTST, iTransformer, TFT, N-BEATS, InceptionTime, ResNet1D\n",
    "- **Ensemble (3):** Voting, Stacking, Blending\n",
    "- **Meta-Learners (4):** Ridge Meta, MLP Meta, Calibrated Meta, XGBoost Meta\n",
    "\n",
    "### Advanced Capabilities\n",
    "- **Heterogeneous Ensembles:** Combine models from different families via OOF stacking\n",
    "- **Transformer Support:** Self-attention with multi-head architecture + attention visualization\n",
    "- **Hyperparameter Tuning:** Optuna integration with configurable trials per model\n",
    "- **Cross-Validation:** Purged K-fold for time series (prevents lookahead bias)\n",
    "- **Professional Export:** ONNX conversion, model cards, ZIP packages\n",
    "\n",
    "### Environment Support\n",
    "- **Google Colab:** T4/A100 GPU with Drive checkpointing\n",
    "- **Local GPU:** RTX 4070 Ti / other NVIDIA GPUs with full memory utilization\n",
    "- **Local CPU:** Fallback mode with optimized batch sizes\n",
    "\n",
    "## Pipeline Phases\n",
    "1. **Configuration** - All settings in one place\n",
    "2. **Environment Setup** - Auto-detects runtime, creates unified CONFIG\n",
    "3. **Phase 1: Data Pipeline** - Clean -> Features -> Labels -> Splits -> Scale\n",
    "4. **Phase 2: Model Training** - Train any model type\n",
    "5. **Phase 3: Cross-Validation** - Robust evaluation (optional)\n",
    "6. **Phase 4: Ensemble** - Combine models (optional)\n",
    "7. **Results & Export** - Professional packages\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 1. CONFIGURATION\n",
    "\n",
    "**Configure ALL settings here. No need to modify any other cells.**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": "#@title 1.1 Master Configuration Panel { display-mode: \"form\" }\n#@markdown ## Runtime Configuration\n#@markdown ---\n\n#@markdown ### Runtime Target\nRUNTIME_TARGET = \"auto\"  #@param [\"auto\", \"colab_hosted\", \"local\"]\n#@markdown - **auto**: Detect environment\n#@markdown - **colab_hosted**: Standard Colab VM\n#@markdown - **local**: Local runtime (Colab \"Connect to local runtime\" or local Jupyter)\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Data Configuration\n\n#@markdown ### Contract Selection\nSYMBOL = \"MGC\"  #@param [\"SI\", \"MES\", \"MGC\", \"ES\", \"GC\", \"NQ\", \"CL\", \"HG\", \"ZB\", \"ZN\"]\n#@markdown Select ONE contract. Each contract is trained in complete isolation.\n\n#@markdown ### Date Range Selection\nDATE_RANGE = \"2019-2024\"  #@param [\"2019-2024\", \"2020-2024\", \"2021-2024\", \"2022-2024\", \"2023-2024\", \"Full Dataset\"]\n\n#@markdown ### Data Paths\nDRIVE_DATA_PATH = \"research/data/raw\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown Google Drive path relative to My Drive (Colab only)\n\nLOCAL_DATA_PATH = \"data/raw\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown Local data path relative to repo root\n\n#@markdown ### Custom Data File (optional)\nCUSTOM_DATA_FILE = \"\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown Leave empty for auto-detection (SYMBOL_1m.parquet)\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Path Configuration\n\n#@markdown ### Repo Root Override (optional)\nREPO_ROOT = \"\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown If set, overrides auto-detection for both Colab and local runtimes\n\n#@markdown ### GitHub Repository URL (Colab only)\nGITHUB_REPO_URL = \"\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown Leave empty to skip git clone\n\n#@markdown ### Project Paths (fallbacks)\nCOLAB_PROJECT_PATH = \"/content/research\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\nLOCAL_PROJECT_ROOT = \"\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown Leave empty to use auto-detection\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Pipeline Configuration\n\n#@markdown ### Label Horizons\nHORIZONS = \"5,10,15,20\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Train/Val/Test Split\nTRAIN_RATIO = 0.70  #@param {type: \"number\"}\nVAL_RATIO = 0.15  #@param {type: \"number\"}\nTEST_RATIO = 0.15  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Leakage Prevention\nPURGE_BARS = 60  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\nEMBARGO_BARS = 1440  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Multi-Timeframe (MTF) Configuration\n\n#@markdown ### Primary Training Timeframe\nPRIMARY_TIMEFRAME = \"5min\"  #@param [\"1min\", \"5min\", \"10min\", \"15min\", \"30min\", \"1h\"]\n#@markdown Base timeframe for training (data resampled from 1-min canonical)\n\n#@markdown ### MTF Strategy\nMTF_STRATEGY = \"default\"  #@param [\"none\", \"minimal\", \"default\", \"aggressive\", \"swing\", \"custom\"]\n#@markdown - **none**: Single timeframe only (no MTF enrichment)\n#@markdown - **minimal**: Base + 1 higher TF (e.g., 5min + 15min)\n#@markdown - **default**: Base + 2 TFs (e.g., 5min + 15min + 1h)\n#@markdown - **aggressive**: Base + 5 TFs (full ladder)\n#@markdown - **swing**: Longer TFs for swing trading (15min base + 1h + daily)\n#@markdown - **custom**: Use CUSTOM_MTF_TIMEFRAMES\n\n#@markdown ### Custom MTF Timeframes (for MTF_STRATEGY = \"custom\")\nCUSTOM_MTF_TIMEFRAMES = \"15min,1h\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\n#@markdown Comma-separated list of additional timeframes\n\n#@markdown ### MTF Mode\nMTF_MODE = \"both\"  #@param [\"bars\", \"indicators\", \"both\"]\n#@markdown - **bars**: Include resampled OHLCV bars\n#@markdown - **indicators**: Include indicator features from MTF\n#@markdown - **both**: Include both bars and indicators\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Per-Model Timeframe Configuration (Advanced)\n#@markdown Override primary timeframe for specific model families\n\n#@markdown ### Boosting Models (XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost)\nBOOSTING_PRIMARY_TF = \"15min\"  #@param [\"same\", \"1min\", \"5min\", \"10min\", \"15min\", \"30min\", \"1h\"]\nBOOSTING_MTF_STRATEGY = \"default\"  #@param [\"same\", \"none\", \"minimal\", \"default\", \"aggressive\"]\n#@markdown Recommended: 15min + MTF indicators (captures trend without noise)\n\n#@markdown ### Neural Sequence Models (LSTM, GRU, TCN)\nNEURAL_PRIMARY_TF = \"5min\"  #@param [\"same\", \"1min\", \"5min\", \"10min\", \"15min\", \"30min\"]\nNEURAL_MTF_STRATEGY = \"none\"  #@param [\"same\", \"none\", \"minimal\", \"default\"]\n#@markdown Recommended: 5min, single-TF (dilated convolutions handle multi-scale)\n\n#@markdown ### Transformer Models (Transformer, PatchTST, iTransformer, TFT)\nTRANSFORMER_PRIMARY_TF = \"1min\"  #@param [\"same\", \"1min\", \"5min\", \"10min\", \"15min\"]\nTRANSFORMER_MTF_STRATEGY = \"minimal\"  #@param [\"same\", \"none\", \"minimal\", \"default\"]\n#@markdown Recommended: 1min + multi-stream (attention learns cross-TF patterns)\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Per-Model Feature Selection\n\n#@markdown ### Feature Selection Mode\nFEATURE_SELECTION_MODE = \"auto\"  #@param [\"auto\", \"manual\", \"none\"]\n#@markdown - **auto**: Let each model family use its optimal feature set\n#@markdown - **manual**: Use MANUAL_FEATURE_COUNT for all models\n#@markdown - **none**: Use all features (not recommended)\n\n#@markdown ### Manual Feature Count (if mode=\"manual\")\nMANUAL_FEATURE_COUNT = 50  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Tabular Model Feature Strategy\nTABULAR_FEATURE_SET = \"boosting_optimal\"  #@param [\"boosting_optimal\", \"indicators_only\", \"mtf_enhanced\", \"all\"]\n#@markdown - **boosting_optimal**: Top 50 MDA-selected features (recommended)\n#@markdown - **indicators_only**: Technical indicators only (~100 features)\n#@markdown - **mtf_enhanced**: Base + MTF indicator features (~150 features)\n#@markdown - **all**: All available features (not recommended)\n\n#@markdown ### Sequence Model Feature Strategy  \nSEQUENCE_FEATURE_SET = \"sequence_raw\"  #@param [\"sequence_raw\", \"returns_volatility\", \"indicators_subset\", \"all\"]\n#@markdown - **sequence_raw**: Returns + volatility only (~20 features, recommended)\n#@markdown - **returns_volatility**: Price returns and volatility measures\n#@markdown - **indicators_subset**: Subset of momentum/trend indicators\n#@markdown - **all**: All features (may add noise)\n\n#@markdown ### Transformer Model Feature Strategy\nTRANSFORMER_FEATURE_SET = \"raw_ohlcv\"  #@param [\"raw_ohlcv\", \"minimal_enriched\", \"indicators_subset\"]\n#@markdown - **raw_ohlcv**: Raw OHLCV only (let attention learn patterns, recommended)\n#@markdown - **minimal_enriched**: OHLCV + returns + volume features\n#@markdown - **indicators_subset**: OHLCV + select momentum indicators\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Model Training Configuration\n\n#@markdown ### Training Horizon\nTRAINING_HORIZON = 20  #@param [5, 10, 15, 20]\n\n#@markdown ### Boosting Models\nTRAIN_XGBOOST = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_LIGHTGBM = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_CATBOOST = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Classical Models\nTRAIN_RANDOM_FOREST = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_LOGISTIC = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_SVM = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Neural Models\nTRAIN_LSTM = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_GRU = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_TCN = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_TRANSFORMER = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_PATCHTST = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_ITRANSFORMER = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_TFT = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_NBEATS = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_INCEPTIONTIME = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_RESNET1D = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Ensemble Models\nTRAIN_VOTING = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_STACKING = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nTRAIN_BLENDING = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Neural Network Settings\nSEQUENCE_LENGTH = 60  #@param {type: \"slider\", min: 30, max: 120, step: 10}\nBATCH_SIZE = 256  #@param [64, 128, 256, 512, 1024]\nMAX_EPOCHS = 50  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\nEARLY_STOPPING_PATIENCE = 10  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Transformer Settings\nTRANSFORMER_SEQUENCE_LENGTH = 128  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\nTRANSFORMER_N_HEADS = 8  #@param [4, 8, 16]\nTRANSFORMER_N_LAYERS = 3  #@param [2, 3, 4, 6]\nTRANSFORMER_D_MODEL = 256  #@param [128, 256, 512]\n\n#@markdown ### Boosting Settings\nN_ESTIMATORS = 500  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\nBOOSTING_EARLY_STOPPING = 50  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Ensemble Configuration\nVOTING_BASE_MODELS = \"xgboost,lightgbm,catboost\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\nSTACKING_BASE_MODELS = \"catboost,tcn,patchtst\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\nSTACKING_META_LEARNER = \"ridge_meta\"  #@param [\"logistic\", \"ridge_meta\", \"xgboost_meta\", \"mlp_meta\"]\nSTACKING_N_FOLDS = 5  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\nBLENDING_BASE_MODELS = \"xgboost,lightgbm,random_forest\"  #@param {type: \"string\"}\nBLENDING_META_LEARNER = \"logistic\"  #@param [\"logistic\", \"ridge_meta\", \"xgboost_meta\"]\nBLENDING_HOLDOUT_RATIO = 0.2  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Class Balancing\nUSE_CLASS_WEIGHTS = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nUSE_SAMPLE_WEIGHTS = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Optional Phases\n\n#@markdown ### Cross-Validation\nRUN_CROSS_VALIDATION = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nCV_N_SPLITS = 5  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\nCV_TUNE_HYPERPARAMS = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nCV_N_TRIALS = 20  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n\n#@markdown ### Ensemble Training\nTRAIN_ENSEMBLE = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nENSEMBLE_TYPE = \"voting\"  #@param [\"voting\", \"stacking\", \"blending\"]\n\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Execution Options\n\nRUN_DATA_PIPELINE = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nRUN_MODEL_TRAINING = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\nSAFE_MODE = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n#@markdown Enable for low-memory environments\n\n#@markdown ### Colab-Specific Options\nUSE_DRIVE = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n#@markdown Mount Google Drive for data and checkpoints\nCHECKPOINT_INTERVAL = 3  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n#@markdown Save checkpoint every N models (Colab timeout protection)\n\n#@markdown ### Reproducibility\nRANDOM_SEED = 42  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n\n# ============================================================\n# DERIVED CONFIGURATION (DO NOT MODIFY)\n# ============================================================\n\n# Parse horizons\nHORIZON_LIST = [int(h.strip()) for h in HORIZONS.split(',')]\n\n# Parse date range\nif DATE_RANGE == \"Full Dataset\":\n    YEAR_START, YEAR_END = None, None\nelse:\n    years = DATE_RANGE.split('-')\n    YEAR_START, YEAR_END = int(years[0]), int(years[1])\n\n# Build model list\nMODELS_TO_TRAIN = []\nif TRAIN_XGBOOST: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('xgboost')\nif TRAIN_LIGHTGBM: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('lightgbm')\nif TRAIN_CATBOOST: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('catboost')\nif TRAIN_RANDOM_FOREST: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('random_forest')\nif TRAIN_LOGISTIC: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('logistic')\nif TRAIN_SVM: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('svm')\nif TRAIN_LSTM: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('lstm')\nif TRAIN_GRU: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('gru')\nif TRAIN_TCN: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('tcn')\nif TRAIN_TRANSFORMER: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('transformer')\nif TRAIN_PATCHTST: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('patchtst')\nif TRAIN_ITRANSFORMER: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('itransformer')\nif TRAIN_TFT: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('tft')\nif TRAIN_NBEATS: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('nbeats')\nif TRAIN_INCEPTIONTIME: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('inceptiontime')\nif TRAIN_RESNET1D: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('resnet1d')\nif TRAIN_VOTING: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('voting')\nif TRAIN_STACKING: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('stacking')\nif TRAIN_BLENDING: MODELS_TO_TRAIN.append('blending')\n\n# Safe mode adjustments\nif SAFE_MODE:\n    BATCH_SIZE = min(BATCH_SIZE, 64)\n    N_ESTIMATORS = min(N_ESTIMATORS, 300)\n    SEQUENCE_LENGTH = min(SEQUENCE_LENGTH, 30)\n\n# MTF Configuration Processing\ndef get_mtf_timeframes(strategy: str, custom: str) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Get MTF timeframes based on strategy.\"\"\"\n    strategies = {\n        \"none\": [],\n        \"minimal\": [\"15min\"],\n        \"default\": [\"15min\", \"1h\"],\n        \"aggressive\": [\"10min\", \"15min\", \"30min\", \"45min\", \"1h\"],\n        \"swing\": [\"1h\", \"4h\"],\n    }\n    if strategy == \"custom\":\n        return [tf.strip() for tf in custom.split(',') if tf.strip()]\n    return strategies.get(strategy, [])\n\nMTF_TIMEFRAMES = get_mtf_timeframes(MTF_STRATEGY, CUSTOM_MTF_TIMEFRAMES)\n\n# Per-model TF config (resolve \"same\" to global setting)\ndef resolve_tf(model_tf: str, global_tf: str) -> str:\n    return global_tf if model_tf == \"same\" else model_tf\n\ndef resolve_mtf_strategy(model_strategy: str, global_strategy: str) -> str:\n    return global_strategy if model_strategy == \"same\" else model_strategy\n\nMODEL_TF_CONFIG = {\n    \"boosting\": {\n        \"primary_tf\": resolve_tf(BOOSTING_PRIMARY_TF, PRIMARY_TIMEFRAME),\n        \"mtf_strategy\": resolve_mtf_strategy(BOOSTING_MTF_STRATEGY, MTF_STRATEGY),\n    },\n    \"neural\": {\n        \"primary_tf\": resolve_tf(NEURAL_PRIMARY_TF, PRIMARY_TIMEFRAME),\n        \"mtf_strategy\": resolve_mtf_strategy(NEURAL_MTF_STRATEGY, MTF_STRATEGY),\n    },\n    \"transformer\": {\n        \"primary_tf\": resolve_tf(TRANSFORMER_PRIMARY_TF, PRIMARY_TIMEFRAME),\n        \"mtf_strategy\": resolve_mtf_strategy(TRANSFORMER_MTF_STRATEGY, MTF_STRATEGY),\n    },\n}\n\n# Feature Selection Configuration\nMODEL_FEATURE_CONFIG = {\n    \"boosting\": {\n        \"feature_set\": TABULAR_FEATURE_SET,\n        \"n_features\": MANUAL_FEATURE_COUNT if FEATURE_SELECTION_MODE == \"manual\" else 50,\n    },\n    \"classical\": {\n        \"feature_set\": TABULAR_FEATURE_SET,\n        \"n_features\": MANUAL_FEATURE_COUNT if FEATURE_SELECTION_MODE == \"manual\" else 40,\n    },\n    \"neural\": {\n        \"feature_set\": SEQUENCE_FEATURE_SET,\n        \"n_features\": MANUAL_FEATURE_COUNT if FEATURE_SELECTION_MODE == \"manual\" else 0,  # 0 = use all\n    },\n    \"transformer\": {\n        \"feature_set\": TRANSFORMER_FEATURE_SET,\n        \"n_features\": MANUAL_FEATURE_COUNT if FEATURE_SELECTION_MODE == \"manual\" else 0,  # 0 = use all\n    },\n}\n\nprint(\"Configuration loaded. Run Cell 2 to initialize environment.\")\nprint(f\"MTF Strategy: {MTF_STRATEGY} -> {MTF_TIMEFRAMES}\")\nprint(f\"Per-model TF config: {MODEL_TF_CONFIG}\")\nprint(f\"Feature Selection Mode: {FEATURE_SELECTION_MODE}\")\nprint(f\"Per-model Feature config: {MODEL_FEATURE_CONFIG}\")"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#@title 1.2 Trading Simulation Configuration { display-mode: \"form\" }\n",
    "#@markdown ---\n",
    "#@markdown ## Trading Simulation Configuration\n",
    "\n",
    "#@markdown ### Transaction Costs\n",
    "COMMISSION_PER_SHARE = 0.0005  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Commission per share (default: $0.0005 = $0.50 per 1000 shares)\n",
    "\n",
    "FIXED_FEE_PER_TRADE = 1.0  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Fixed fee per trade (default: $1.00)\n",
    "\n",
    "SLIPPAGE_BPS = 5.0  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Slippage in basis points (default: 5 bps = 0.05%)\n",
    "\n",
    "#@markdown ### Position Sizing\n",
    "POSITION_SIZING_METHOD = \"kelly\"  #@param [\"fixed\", \"kelly\", \"kelly_half\", \"volatility_scaled\"]\n",
    "#@markdown - **fixed**: Same size all trades\n",
    "#@markdown - **kelly**: Full Kelly criterion\n",
    "#@markdown - **kelly_half**: Half-Kelly (more conservative)\n",
    "#@markdown - **volatility_scaled**: Scale by inverse volatility\n",
    "\n",
    "FIXED_POSITION_SIZE = 100  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Shares per trade if using fixed sizing\n",
    "\n",
    "MAX_POSITION_PCT = 0.25  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Maximum position as % of capital (Kelly limiter)\n",
    "\n",
    "INITIAL_CAPITAL = 100000  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Starting capital for simulation (default: $100k)\n",
    "\n",
    "#@markdown ### Risk Management\n",
    "USE_STOP_LOSS = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n",
    "STOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.02  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Stop loss as % of position (default: 2%)\n",
    "\n",
    "USE_TAKE_PROFIT = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n",
    "TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.06  #@param {type: \"number\"}\n",
    "#@markdown Take profit as % of position (default: 6%)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Trading simulation configuration loaded.\")\n",
    "print(f\"Position sizing: {POSITION_SIZING_METHOD}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Initial capital: ${INITIAL_CAPITAL:,}\")\n",
    "\n#@markdown ---\n#@markdown ## Explainability Configuration\n\n#@markdown ### SHAP Analysis\nRUN_SHAP_ANALYSIS = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n#@markdown Run SHAP explainability analysis (slower, requires shap library)\n\nSHAP_BACKGROUND_SAMPLES = 100  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n#@markdown Number of background samples for SHAP (lower = faster)\n\nSHAP_TEST_SAMPLES = 50  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n#@markdown Number of test samples to explain (lower = faster)\n\n#@markdown ### Feature Importance\nSHOW_FEATURE_IMPORTANCE = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n#@markdown Show feature importance for tree-based models\n\nTOP_N_FEATURES = 20  #@param {type: \"integer\"}\n#@markdown Number of top features to display\n\n#@markdown ### Export Options\nEXPORT_SHAP_VALUES = False  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n#@markdown Export SHAP values to CSV for external dashboards\n\nEXPORT_FEATURE_IMPORTANCE = True  #@param {type: \"boolean\"}\n#@markdown Export feature importance to JSON\n",
    "print(f\"Slippage: {SLIPPAGE_BPS} bps\")\n"
   ]
  },
